:: Beach Day Encounter
<<location "beach">><<effects>>

<<silently>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000>><</silently>>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	You walk over to the <<person>> who pretends not to notice you until you stop in front of <<him>>.
	<<if playerBellyVisible()>>
		<<He>> notices your pregnant belly once you've gotten close enough. "My my!" <<he>> exclaims with glee. "Ready to be a mum already?"
	<<else>>
		<<He>> looks at you but doesn't speak.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Flirt (0:05)|Beach Day Encounter]]>><<pass 5>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<promiscuous1>>
	<br>
	<<if between(Time.hour, 7, 19) and !Weather.isOvercast and Weather.temperature gte 10>>
		<<cosmeticsicon "sunscreen">><<link [[Offer to apply sunscreen (0:03)|Beach Day Encounter Sunscreen 1]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<promiscuous1>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 or (!$statFreeze and $arousalDesensitizedTrait is 1) or (typeof activeInsanityTrait === "function" and activeInsanityTrait())>>
		<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Friendly chat (0:10)|Beach Day Encounter]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 10>><<stress -2>><<trauma -1>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
		<br>
		<<getouticon>><<destinationBeach "Leave">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationBeach>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $willpowerSuccess>>
		<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Friendly chat (0:10)|Beach Day Encounter]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 10>><<stress -2>><<trauma -1>><<willpowersuccess>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
		<br>
		<<getouticon>><<destinationBeach "Leave">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<willpowersuccess>><</destinationBeach>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="lewd">You're too horny, and nothing but sex fills your thoughts.</span>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	<<if playerBellyVisible()>>
		You manage to strike an engaging conversation with <<him>>. It becomes clear to you that the stress of parenthood is really getting to <<him>>. "Kid's got a father too, I imagine?"
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Say you are single|Beach Day Encounter Pregnancy Talk]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Say you know the father|Beach Day Encounter Pregnancy Talk]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<speechresolve>>
		<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
			<<case "meek">>
				You try to coax <<him>> out of <<his>> shell with gentle small talk, stumbling a little whenever <<he>> actually answers. <<He>> responds politely, though you still end up doing most of the talking. More than once, you catch <<him>> sneaking a glance at your body when <<he>> thinks you are not looking.
			<<case "shy">>
				You keep the conversation light and harmless, careful not to say anything too forward. <<He>> answers in a reserved way, and the two of you circle awkwardly around the silence until you notice <<him>> eyeing you up when <<he>> thinks you are not looking.
			<<case "polite">>
				You make pleasant conversation about the beach, the weather, and whatever else comes to mind, doing your best to put <<him>> at ease. <<He>> responds with quiet courtesy, though you still carry most of the exchange. Every so often, you catch <<him>> letting <<his>> gaze linger on you.
			<<case "flamboyant">>
				You keep up an easy stream of playful conversation, all bright smiles and easy charm, until <<him>>'s reserve starts to crack. <<He>> remains polite, if flustered, and before long you notice <<him>> stealing admiring looks whenever <<he>> thinks you will not catch <<him>>.
			<<case "docile">>
				You speak softly, careful not to press too hard, and gradually draw <<him>> into a calmer rhythm of conversation. <<He>> answers politely, though you still do most of the work. Once or twice, you catch <<him>> studying you out of the corner of <<his>> eye.
			<<case "confident">>
				You take charge of the conversation with easy confidence, steering it past the awkward pauses before they can settle in. <<He>> responds more than you expected, though you still lead the exchange. It does not escape your notice that <<his>> eyes keep drifting back to you.
			<<case "bratty">>
				You tease <<him>> out of <<his>> shell with little jabs and knowing smiles, enjoying the way <<he>> struggles not to react. <<He>> stays polite, but you soon catch <<him>> checking you out whenever <<he>> thinks you are not paying attention.
			<<case "cruel">>
				You keep the conversation going with a faintly amused edge, as though testing how long <<him>> can keep up <<his>> quiet composure. <<He>> remains polite, but you still do most of the talking. More than once, you catch <<him>> looking you over when <<he>> thinks you will not notice.
			<<default>>
				You try to bring <<him>> out of <<his>> shell by talking about innocuous things. <<He>> responds politely, but you do most of the talking. You catch <<him>> eyeing you up when <<he>> thinks you are not looking.
		<</switch>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Flirt (0:05)|Beach Day Encounter]]>><<pass 5>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<promiscuous1>>
		<br>
		<<if $arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 or (!$statFreeze and $arousalDesensitizedTrait is 1) or (typeof activeInsanityTrait === "function" and activeInsanityTrait())>>
			<<destinationBeach "Say goodbye">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationBeach>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $willpowerSuccess>>
			<<destinationBeach "Say goodbye">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationBeach>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<span class="lewd">You're too horny, and nothing but sex fills your thoughts.</span>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
		<<case "meek">>
			You sit on the towel beside <<him>> and lean in enough for your shoulder to brush <<his>>. In a soft voice, you tell <<him>> that <<he>> seems like a terrific parent, and that even someone like <<him>> must need a little stress relief now and then.
		<<case "shy">>
			You edge closer on the towel and speak a little more quietly than you meant to, complimenting <<him>> on how patient <<he>> has been with <<his>> children before suggesting <<he>> might deserve some stress relief.
		<<case "polite">>
			You settle beside <<him>> with a composed smile and tell <<him>> that <<he>> seems like a terrific parent. From there, you gently suggest that even the most attentive parent needs a chance to unwind.
		<<case "flamboyant">>
			You drift down beside <<him>> with a bright smile and a knowing look. Praising <<him>> for being such a devoted parent, you smoothly add that even saints deserve a little stress relief from time to time.
		<<case "docile">>
			You sit beside <<him>> with quiet care and praise <<him>> for how attentive <<he>> has been. Then, in a low voice, you suggest that <<he>> must be in need of some stress relief every now and then.
		<<case "confident">>
			You sit beside <<him>> as though the place was already yours and lean close enough to make the implication obvious. You tell <<him>> <<he>> is a terrific parent, then add that someone carrying that much strain must need a way to let it out.
		<<case "bratty">>
			You drop down beside <<him>> with a sly smile and tell <<him>> that <<he>> is a terrific parent. Then you tilt your head and add that all that self-control must leave <<him>> desperate for some stress relief.
		<<case "cruel">>
			You settle beside <<him>> with deliberate intimacy, praising <<him>> for playing the devoted parent before wondering aloud how long <<he>> can keep that act up without needing some stress relief.
		<<default>>
			You sit on the towel beside <<him>> and lean close. You tell <<him>> <<he>> is a terrific parent, but that <<he>> must be in need of stress relief every now and then.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCList[0].penis is "clothed">>
		<<He>> shifts <<his>> legs as if to conceal something.
	<<else>>
		<<He>> blushes with increasing intensity as you continue.
	<</if>>
	<<promiscuity1>>
	<br><br>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2) or ($arousal gte $arousalmax * 3/5 and !$willpowerSuccess)>>
		<<link [[Seduce|Beach Day Encounter]]>><<set $phase to 4>><</link>> <<seductiondifficulty>><<promiscuous2>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Stop|Beach Day Encounter]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
	Satisfied with the effect, you stand and take your leave.
	<br><br>

	<<destinationBeach "Next">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationBeach>>
	<br>
<<elseif $phase is 4>>
	<<seductionskilluptext>>
	<<seductionskilluse>>

	<<if 1000 - ($rng * 10) - currentSkillValue("seductionskill") - ($attractiveness / 10) lte -100>>
		Gazing into <<his>> eyes, you press your body against <<hers>> and make it absolutely clear what your intentions are. <<He>> glances at <<his>> kids. Satisfied that they're distracted, <<he>> turns and embraces you, <<his>> heart beating furiously.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Beach Day Encounter Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Gazing into <<his>> eyes, you press your body against <<hers>> and make it absolutely clear what your intentions are. Stammering excuses, <<he>> recoils from your advance and leaves to check on <<his>> children.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Never mind|Beach]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Beach Day Encounter Sunscreen 1
<<effects>><<wearProp "sunscreen">>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek">>
		You sit on the towel and reach for the tube of sunscreen next to <<him>>. "W-want me to put some on you?" you ask, trying for a brave little smile. <<promiscuity1>>
	<<case "shy">>
		You pick up the sunscreen and glance at <<him>> from under your lashes. "Do you want me to help with that?" you ask softly. <<promiscuity1>>
	<<case "polite">>
		You settle beside <<him>> and take the sunscreen in hand. "Would you like me to put some on you?" you ask with an easy smile. <<promiscuity1>>
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		You pluck up the sunscreen with a bright grin and angle yourself into <<his>> view. "Darling, would you like a hand with this?" you ask. <<promiscuity1>>
	<<case "docile">>
		You reach for the sunscreen and hold it up for <<him>> to see. "If you want... I could put some on you," you offer quietly. <<promiscuity1>>
	<<case "confident">>
		You take the sunscreen and give <<him>> a knowing look. "Here, let me do that for you," you say. <<promiscuity1>>
	<<case "bratty">>
		You snatch up the sunscreen with a teasing smile. "You look like you need help," you say. "Lucky for you, I'm generous." <<promiscuity1>>
	<<case "cruel">>
		You pick up the sunscreen and let the offer hang in the air just long enough to make <<him>> squirm. "Go on," you murmur. "I can do a better job than you." <<promiscuity1>>
	<<default>>
		You sit on the towel and reach for the tube of sunscreen next to <<him>>. "Want me to put some on you?" you ask with a wink. <<promiscuity1>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<He>> blushes. "O-Okay."
<br><br>
You whirl your finger for <<him>>, and <<he>> obligingly turns around. You put a generous amount of sunscreen on your hands and start to massage it into <<his>> back. <<He>> is tense at first,
<<if currentSkillValue("handskill") gte 400>>
	but <<he>> starts to relax the more you work.
<<else>>
	and only gets more tense as you fumble through the massage.
<</if>>
<<ghandskill>><<handskill 1>>
<br><br>
<<if hasSexStat('promiscuity', 2)>>
	<<link [[Go lower|Beach Day Encounter Sunscreen 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
<<else>>
	<<insufficientStat "promiscuity" "to go further">>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Stop|Beach Day Encounter Sunscreen 2]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>

:: Beach Day Encounter Sunscreen 2
<<effects>><<wearProp "sunscreen">>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	You finish applying the sunscreen. <<He>> nods at you, blushing so red it looks like <<he>> already burnt. Winking, you walk away, leaving <<him>> with <<his>> children.
	<br><br>

	<<destinationBeach "Next">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationBeach>>
<<else>>
	<<speechresolve>>
	You move your hands down <<his>> back. <<He>> glances back at you, a question in <<his>> eyes. You press your body against <<his>> before <<he>> can ask. <<promiscuity2>>
	<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
		<<case "meek">>
			"I think... even a perfect parent needs a little stress relief, don't you?" 
		<<case "shy">>
			"You must get tired, looking after everyone," you say softly. "Even a perfect parent deserves a little stress relief."
		<<case "polite">>
			"I think even a perfect parent needs a little stress relief now and then, don't you?" you say with quiet confidence.
		<<case "flamboyant">>
			"Even a perfect parent deserves to be spoiled a little," you purr. "Surely you can spare a moment for some stress relief."
		<<case "docile">>
			"You work so hard..." you murmur. "Even a perfect parent needs a little stress relief sometimes."
		<<case "confident">>
			"You're wound tight enough to snap," you say against <<his>> ear. "Even a perfect parent needs some stress relief."
		<<case "bratty">>
			"I think even a perfect parent gets desperate eventually," you tease. "So? Want a little stress relief or not?"
		<<case "cruel">>
			"You have been trying so hard to behave," you murmur. "Even a perfect parent needs somewhere to put all that tension."
		<<default>>
			"I think even a perfect parent needs a little stress relief, don't you?" 
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	/* if passed the handskill check before, requires lower seduction difficulty */
	<<set $seductiondifficulty to currentSkillValue("handskill") gte 401 ? 4000 : 6000>>
	<<seductioncheck>>
	<<seductionskilluptext>>
	<<seductionskilluse>>

	You nibble on <<his>> ear for emphasis.
	<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired>>
		<<He>> glances at <<his>> kids. Satisfied that they're distracted, <span class="green"><<he>> turns and embraces you</span>, <<his>> heart beating furiously.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Beach Day Encounter Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Stammering excuses, <span class="red"><<he>> recoils from your advance</span> and leaves to check on <<his>> children.
		<br><br>

		<<destinationBeach "Next">><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</destinationBeach>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


